{"ref":"BDB, רָחָב²","hw":"רָחָב²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָחָב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.f.</strong> harlot in Jericho;—<a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:1\" href=\"/Joshua.2.1\">Jos 2:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:3\" href=\"/Joshua.2.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:17\" href=\"/Joshua.6.17\">6:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:23\" href=\"/Joshua.6.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:25\" href=\"/Joshua.6.25\">25</a> (all JE); Ρααβ (so Heb 3:11; Jas 2:25, but Mt 1:5 Ραχαβ).","next":"BDB, רְחוֹב","prev":"BDB, רָחָב"}